# The CAD - Casting Assistance Device. G-vii task 3b, the mod's first 3D model.
#
# Converted from docs/CAD/minecraft_pistol.obj (FabConvert, from the owner's GLB).
# The mesh, its UVs and its normals are UNTOUCHED. Three things were added or changed,
# each recorded in ai/tasks/phase-G/G-vii-cad-plan.md section 0.1e:
#
#   1. mtllib is a resource location, so the loader can find the MTL at all.
#   2. mat2 is gone from the MTL - it had no map_Kd and no face ever used it.
#   3. The cad_glow group below is a DUPLICATE of every mat0 face that touches a crimson
#      texel, pushed 0.05 units along its own normals and wearing the emissive mask.
#      That is the whole of the selective glow: NeoForge bakes a lightmap into a quad from
#      its material's Ka, and VertexConsumer.applyBakedLighting takes the MAX of that and
#      the world's light - so a second material glows with no second render pass and no
#      Java at all. The offset is what keeps it from z-fighting with the face beneath.


mtllib isekubed:models/item/cad.mtl

